      "GridApi_LinkToWebJourneyRun_LinkParams": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "This object specifies the link to the Web Journey Run report:\n\"/web-journey/{webJourneyId}/run/{webJourneyRunId}/results?action={actionSequenceNr}&tab={webJourneyRunReportTab}\"\n\nThis object specifies \n1. column IDs which values are used to populate variables in Web Journey Run report link template, and\n2. the tab to open in the Web Journey Run report.\nLink template examples:\n- \"/web-journey/{webJourneyId}/run/{webJourneyRunId}/results?action={actionSequenceNr}&tab={webJourneyRunReportTab}\"\n- \"/web-journey/{webJourneyId}/run/{webJourneyRunId}/rules\"\n",
        "required": [
